@startuml Navigation_State_Machine
title B.A.D. - App Navigation State Machine

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state Startup <<choice>>
[*] --> Startup
Startup --> TIMING_CALIBRATION : no active calibration
Startup --> PRACTICE : active calibration exists

PRACTICE --> EXERCISE_LIBRARY : load exercise
PRACTICE --> EXERCISE_LIBRARY : modify exercise
PRACTICE --> EXERCISE_EDITOR : create exercise
PRACTICE --> SETTINGS : settings
PRACTICE --> PROCESSING : natural exercise completion

EXERCISE_LIBRARY --> PRACTICE : choose exercise for practice
EXERCISE_LIBRARY --> EXERCISE_EDITOR : choose exercise to modify
EXERCISE_LIBRARY --> PRACTICE : back

EXERCISE_EDITOR --> PRACTICE : back after create
EXERCISE_EDITOR --> EXERCISE_LIBRARY : back after library edit
EXERCISE_EDITOR --> PRACTICE : play saved exercise

SETTINGS --> TIMING_CALIBRATION : calibrate / recalibrate
SETTINGS --> PRACTICE : back
TIMING_CALIBRATION --> PRACTICE : accept, reject, or back

PROCESSING --> RESULTS : complete result + verdict delay
PROCESSING --> PROCESSING : system back ignored
PROCESSING --> PRACTICE : unrecoverable finalization failure + tap

state RESULTS {
  [*] --> SUMMARY
  SUMMARY --> DETAILS : Detailed results
  DETAILS --> SUMMARY : back
  SUMMARY --> DEBUG_ANALYSIS : Open debug analysis [debug build]
  DEBUG_ANALYSIS --> SUMMARY : back
}

RESULTS --> PRACTICE : back / Practice
RESULTS --> PRACTICE : Retry (new recording)
RESULTS --> EXERCISE_LIBRARY : Exercise library

note right of PROCESSING
  Dedicated destination.
  AppUiState.navigateBack() returns the same state.
end note

note right of RESULTS
  PracticeResult and ProductionGraphModel
  are held by AppUiState while Results is open.
end note
@enduml
